Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:19.93,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\an2}I'll show you how to live
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.18,0:23:23.82,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}在那笨拙的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.07,0:23:29.42,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}仰望你耀眼的微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:34.15,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}被染上樱色
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:37.05,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\an2}I just say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.34,0:23:39.84,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\an2}you show me how to live
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.12,0:23:42.58,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\an2}I'll show you how to love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.77,0:23:46.36,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}青涩的激动
